  "infiniti":"Capture the header with the menu both open and closed at a phone width. Review contrast, spacing and the buyer’s route to sales alongside the supplier’s approved asset and current dated instructions.",
  "jeep":"Use the vehicle’s own documentation and actual photos to distinguish the factory configuration from fitted accessories. Record what still requires a physical inspection by the dealership.",
