  "mini":"Put the two MINI galleries side by side, compare the visible roof or interior details and read the stock reference the salesperson receives. Preserve the vehicle photos separately from approved brand artwork.",
  "mitsubishi":"Give the reviewer an inventory of current page URLs, replacement destinations and unresolved eligibility questions. Assign a named contact to each decision needed before changing public routing.",
  "nissan":"Check the last valid feed entry, the sold update and the outstanding customer question. Give the Nissan sales team a way to identify the shopper who may need another vehicle choice.",
